{"id":"a4db441ff403134f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per.md","title":"不交和类型的成员 PER","display":"df-disjoint-sum-membership-per — 不交和类型的成员 PER","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per","aliases":["72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per"],"display":"df-disjoint-sum-membership-per — 不交和类型的成员 PER","depends_on":["[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.5 disjoint unions, print739–740/PDF751–752; local PER extension of §3.9","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"constructor disjointness, PER argument and lift theorem checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-disjoint-sum-membership-per — 不交和类型的成员 PER"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.5 disjoint unions, print739–740/PDF751–752; local PER extension of §3.9"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"constructor disjointness, PER argument and lift theorem checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>。给定单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}:T\\to T\">\\(\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}:T\\to T\\)</span>，两像不交，且每个注入项自求值；采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a> 的扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q^+_{\\alpha,\\beta}:=\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf{inl}(a),\\mathsf{inl}(a&#39;)\\rangle:a\\alpha a&#39;\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{inr}(b),\\mathsf{inr}(b&#39;)\\rangle:b\\beta b&#39;\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q^+_{\\alpha,\\beta}:=\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf{inl}(a),\\mathsf{inl}(a&#39;)\\rangle:a\\alpha a&#39;\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{inr}(b),\\mathsf{inr}(b&#39;)\\rangle:b\\beta b&#39;\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta:=(Q^+_{\\alpha,\\beta})^\\Downarrow,\\qquad\n\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta:=(Q^+_{\\alpha,\\beta})^\\Downarrow,\\qquad\n\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个标签分支内的对称传递来自各自的 PER；跨标签不能共享中间值，因为注入像不交。于是 Q⁺ 是 PER，预求值扩张保持 PER 并使其对 Kleene 相等饱和。本地扩展精确实现书中不交和的成员相等规则，未冒称 p.746 已直接列出这一 PER 公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$、$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。给定单射 $\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}:T\\to T$，两像不交，且每个注入项自求值；采用 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]、[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]] 的扩张。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$、$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。给定单射 $\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}:T\\to T$，两像不交，且每个注入项自求值；采用 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]、[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]] 的扩张。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}:T\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"Q^+_{\\alpha,\\beta}:=\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf{inl}(a),\\mathsf{inl}(a')\\rangle:a\\alpha a'\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{inr}(b),\\mathsf{inr}(b')\\rangle:b\\beta b'\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta:=(Q^+_{\\alpha,\\beta})^\\Downarrow,\\qquad\n\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).","display":true}],"bytes":1825,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-200","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-570","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"2a57555074c2fb5c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\beta,\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}$ 采用 [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] 的全部结构条件及输出PER资格。$R:=\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta$；注入项均自求值、单射且两像不交。类与商集取既有 PER 接口；$q_+$ 在下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["d79ea25f75d5218c","b9c13fa158735675"]}